p&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd6833ea428f60d799a17fe1a01f4596 3x"}, "body": "Hello I recently discovered you and love your art! I would love to have my character drawn exploring the in one of the zones of Pokemon Legends: Arceus or maybe relaxing at one of the camp sites (I am happy with either!). As for the specific details, I don't really have any must haves so i would like to let you freely choose what you feel wouold be best/fun for you!\n\nThank you very much for considering my request!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/7erbD2P", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MeiFordArt/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1595557, "client_id": 946151, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/793b4893-9d92-4962-837c-0b3318c5f13d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbaa976abb721f4ad5f7b2510c1ac552", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/793b4893-9d92-4962-837c-0b3318c5f13d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbaa976abb721f4ad5f7b2510c1ac552, https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/793b4893-9d92-4962-837c-0b3318c5f13d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=974f129fc8ac3c5d2b746fe496ecc17d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/793b4893-9d92-4962-837c-0b3318c5f13d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57a21b13a6950d9ac92c2e0b12caeb6f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/793b4893-9d92-4962-837c-0b3318c5f13d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cd26cc41ac9cde48087c5c82f5338f63", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d8b5fec/uploads/origins/7